For debugging purposes, the macros:

IOStreamUtilsTest.C  
StringTest.C  
TokenizeTest.C

should be steered via the macro "runMacro.C", i.e.:

o to start the individual applications, type:

  root -l runMacro.C'(".x *.C++")'

  with * = name of the macro (e.g. * = IOStreamUtilsTest)

o to create only a shared library, type:

  root -l runMacro.C'(".L *.C++")'
